---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy Policy · CDM Motorsport"
  description="CDM Motorsport Privacy Policy: data collection, legal basis, GDPR rights, cookies."
>
  <section class="pad" style="padding-top:clamp(120px,15vw,180px)">
    <div class="wrap prose reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:16px">Legal information</div>
      <div class="big" style="margin-bottom:18px">Privacy Policy</div>

      <div class="note" style="background:#fff6ec;border-left-color:#b56a5a;color:#6b4a3a;margin-bottom:28px">
        <strong>This is an informative translation.</strong> The French version prevails in case of dispute.
      </div>

      <div class="note">
        Demonstration text. The final wording must be validated (ideally by a lawyer) before
        going live.
      </div>

      <h2>Data collected</h2>
      <p>
        The data submitted via the contact form (name, email, message) is used solely to
        respond to your request. [To be completed.]
      </p>

      <h2>Legal basis &amp; retention</h2>
      <p>
        Processing is based on your consent; data is kept only for the time strictly
        necessary. [To be completed.]
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Access, rectification, erasure: contact us at info@cdmmotorsport.com. GDPR compliant.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        The site uses analytics cookies subject to your consent. [To be completed.]
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
